<title>USA: ACNielsen in data pact with Safeway.</title>
<headline>ACNielsen in data pact with Safeway.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACNielsen Corp said Wednesday it signed an agreement to report chain-specific census data from Safeway Inc, the nation's third-largest supermarket chain with 1,052 stores in North America.</p>
<p>ACNielsen's census system allows manufacturers of consumer packaged goods to view Safeway relative to competing chain supermarket retailers in a defined geographic region, the company said.</p>
<p>ACNielsen offers market research services in more than 90 countries.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 1/8 Wednesday at 14-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
